  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity development on SRHR with focus on the right to safe and legal abortions and LGBTI-issues.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kompetensutveckling inom SRHR med fokus p&#xe5; r&#xe4;tten till s&#xe4;ker och laglig abort och HBTQ-fr&#xe5;gor</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the&#xa0;contribution is to conduct Values Clarification and Attitude Transformation (VCAT) workshops for Regional SRHR team&#xb4;s partner organisations and Embassies in the region.</narrative>
